OL,3,GNEWSASchool term pedestrian crossing
OL,4,Amade permanent
OL,5,
OL,6,FA trial pedestrian crossing to help
OL,7,Fchildren and families get to school
OL,8,Fsafely in St Helier will become
OL,9,Fpermanent, the government has said.
OL,11,FThe part-time crossing on Clarence Road
OL,12,Fat the junction with Pleasant Street,
OL,13,FGrosvenor Street and College Hill will
OL,14,Foperate during school term time between
OL,15,F07:45 and 08:45, and 14:25 and 15:45.
OL,17,FOfficials said the trial had been a
OL,18,Fsuccess and it would be made permanent,
OL,19,Fin addition to safer school zones
OL,20,Facross the island.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
